  "description": "“I want to see you again… naked.”\n\n It is the age of fierce competition among idols. Some manage to shine, but far more lose their light too soon and quietly fade away. To help young former idols who were forced to end their careers at an early age and are left drifting without direction, the government launches a vocational training program. And from it, a new app service is born: “Housework Idols”: Former male idols will expertly take care of your household chores!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002722)",
